---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: One zip for the players and for the store
    accDescr: From the signed tag, the build of the release runs scripts/package-extension.sh, describes the zip in the SBOMs, attests it and attaches it to the draft, and the published release can't change any more. A player downloads the zip and loads it unpacked. publish-store.yml checks its signed provenance and its version, and the Chrome Web Store gets exactly that file; a release without the zip, a zip without a valid provenance or of another version stays off the store, and the run fails.

    tag["The signed tag of the release"]
    hook["The build of the release<br>runs scripts/package-extension.sh"]
    attest["It describes the zip in the SBOMs,<br>attests it and attaches it to the draft"]
    release["The published release,<br>which can't change any more"]
    player["A player downloads the zip<br>and loads it unpacked"]
    check["publish-store.yml checks its signed<br>provenance and its version"]
    store["The Chrome Web Store<br>gets exactly that file"]
    off["It stays off the store,<br>and the run fails"]

    tag --> hook --> attest --> release
    release --> player
    release --> check --> store
    check -- "no zip, no valid provenance<br>or another version" --> off

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    class hook,attest,check bot
    class release,player,store done
    class off person
